                = succeed "." do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%28%E2%88%922%29-groupoid"} (−2)-groupoid
          %p
            In this sense, the object
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi true
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} true
            in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Set"} Set
            or
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%E2%88%9EGrpd"} ∞Grpd
            may canonically be thought of as being
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/generalized+the"} the
            unique
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%28%E2%88%922%29-groupoid"} (−2)-groupoid
